{
  "description": "Durable Execution Telemetry error.name reduction vectors (spec version 2). Input is a type string; expected is the reported error.name. Blank means only the six ASCII whitespace characters (space, \\t, \\n, \\r, \\f, \\v); names are never trimmed. Shared byte-for-byte across the JS, Python and Java exporters. Do not edit in one repo only.",
  "version": 2,
  "reduce": [
